{title: Ae Dil Mujhe Bata De}
{artist: Geeta Dutt Madan Mohan}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Ae [D]dil mujhe bata de,        tu kis pe aa gaya [A]hai
Woh [A]kaun hai jo aakar,        khwaabon pe chhaa gaya [D]hai
[D]Masti bhara tara [A]na,        kyon raat gaa rahi [G]hai
[G]Aankhon mein neend aakar,        kyon [A]door jaa rahi [D]hai
[D]Dil mein koi sitamgar,        armaan jaga gaya [A]hai
[A]Woh kaun hai jo aakar,        khwaabon pe chhaa gaya [D]hai
[D]Betaab ho raha [A]hai,        yeh dil machal machal [G]ke
[G]Shaayad yeh raat beete,        [A]karwat badal badal [D]ke
[D]Lal lal laa [G]lal lal la,        [A]lal lal [D]laa lal lal laa
[D]Ae dil zara sambhal jaa,        shaayad woh aa gaya [A]hai
[A]Woh kaun hai jo aakar,        khwaabon pe chhaa gaya [D]hai
[D]Bheegi hui hawaa [A]yein,        mausam bhi hai [G]gulaabi
[G]Kya chaand kya sitaare,        har [A]cheez hai sha [D]raabi
[D]Dheere se ek naghma,        koi suna gaya [A]hai
[A]Woh kaun hai jo aakar,        khwaabon pe chhaa gaya [D]hai
